WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:02.980
Operation successful!

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:07.730
This is the power of my greatest invention, the Vivid System!

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.230
The Vivid System?

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.410
Do you want to help?

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:21.870
In this world, the only ones with the power to fight the Alones are you!

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.710
Sure!

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:26.380
Yes!

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.750
Very well. Listen closely!

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.880
It's docking time!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.510
Docking?

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:21.570
Docking?

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.290
What's that, Gramps?

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:24.990
Look!

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.420
According to my calculations,

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:33.170
if you two docked, you could resist,

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:35.090
or even defeat an Alone!

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.670
We could defeat it?

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:44.180
The ship!

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.060
Let's do it, Aoi!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.100
Let's dock and save everyone!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.900
But how could I do something that great?

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:56.530
If you really want to try, the conditions are all in place.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.860
Conditions?

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.320
I'll do it!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.870
I want to save everyone by Akane's side!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:04.660
Aoi!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:11.710
What's this?

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:14.750
The unique key that can save the world!

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:17.760
It's your key, Aoi.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.130
My key?

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.890
Do it! Commence Operation!

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:24.050
Yes!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.600
Ignition!

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.100
Texture On!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.440
I did it! I could transform too!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.860
Look, Akane!

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.900
That's so cool, Aoi!

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:20.780
Watch out!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.870
Sis... Gramps...

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.120
The island!

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.080
How dare they?!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.510
What?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:46.090
Operation Naked Rang!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.580
So cool, Akane!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.600
This is Q105. I'm hit!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.060
The ejection seat won't work! I can't bail out!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.940
Aoi!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.690
It's coming this way!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.280
Um...

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.790
Are you okay?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.250
A girl?!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.080
That's amazing, Aoi!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.140
Sorry for all the trouble!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:10.850
Uh, no problem...

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:14.430
Whoa, Aoi! You held up a fighter jet!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:17.480
I couldn't even stand on my hands before...

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:21.020
This is mine?

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.240
Operation Naked Impact!

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.910
This is my weapon...

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:37.660
I'm sorry!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.120
I'll pay for it!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.090
Aoi?

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.180
Whoa Aoi, that's a gigantic homerun!

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.060
Others always had to protect me, but with this...

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.200
With this I can fight by Akane's side!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.570
Are we dreaming?

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:13.070
Who knows?

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.460
That's...

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:20.250
Chief!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:24.170
The Manifestor Engine is sending tremendous amounts of energy somewhere!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.460
Don't panic. It's probably—

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.800
System intrusion!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:36.060
So it really was you, Dr. Isshiki.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.430
It's been a while, Shijou.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.980
I'm borrowing the Engine for a bit!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.810
Your predictions were correct.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:48.150
If only we believed what you said back then...

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.320
This is no time for regret.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.160
This is the time to fight, Shijou!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:54.780
Yes!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.960
Lieutenant, what does that look like to you?

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.710
Two girls, I must say.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.300
Missiles couldn't hit it, but flying little girls can?!

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.550
This is the chief of the Manifestor Engine management.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:21.180
As the person in charge, I will now address all personnel currently occupied with the defense of Blue Island.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:26.190
You may have some doubts that what you're seeing is real,

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:31.190
but one thing is absolutely certain:

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:42.160
Those girls have the power to fight this enemy we're facing, the Alone!

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:46.330
Please support them to the best of your abilities!

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.750
Our future is in their hands!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.930
Aoi, did you see that?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:56.680
Yeah!

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:18.450
Naked Rang!

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:42.520
It's my turn to protect everyone!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.410
Aoi!

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.030
<i>This spot looks different!</i>

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.830
Could it be?!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.750
Akane! Target it there!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:07.830
All right!

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.990
The Alone's energy signal is vanishing rapidly.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.740
It's now nonoperational.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.700
Well done, girls!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.950
End it once and for all now!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:46.620
Sure!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.250
Okay!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.540
Here we go! Docking Operation!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.790
Kiss Akane!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.880
Kiss?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:57.970
Sure thing!

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.220
Akane...

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.600
Not like that! On her forehead!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:04.850
Her forehead!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.810
Oh, that's what you meant?

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:09.230
Here, go on!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.190
<i>What's this?</i>

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.700
<i>Something's flowing into me.</i>

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.740
<i>I can see Aoi's memories...</i>

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.790
<i>I can see Akane's memories...</i>

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:38.960
Gramps, we can't Dock! It's broken!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.090
That can't be!

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.680
What?!

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:48.270
Girls! I figured out the problem!

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.270
Really? Can you fix it?

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.850
Not possible.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:59.110
You haven't got enough power to Dock.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:03.860
One of you is rejecting Docking subconsciously.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:08.870
So the root of the problem is the strength of your friendship!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:10.620
Our friendship?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:22.760
I see.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:25.260
When can you come visit me, Father?

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:29.520
I'm sorry Aoi, but not for a while now.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.480
But remember, the doctors said that

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:35.690
having you treated there would be the best for your body.

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:36.520
Do your best.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.440
Of course, Father.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.800
Are you all right, Milady?

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:09.350
Yes!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:10.350
I'm so sorry!

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:12.310
Did I hit you?

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.770
You didn't.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.560
Phew, what a relief.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:19.480
Oh, right! Do you like tomatoes?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:21.940
Yeah.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.240
Here! Take it if you'd like!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.450
Thank you...

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.950
It's really delicious and sweet!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.200
See you!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.230
Morning!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.980
So you lived here!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.980
It's quite a house!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.070
Yeah!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:04.780
See ya!

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.780
Um, thank you!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.870
The tomato you gave me was really good!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:14.370
Can you tell me where I could buy some more?

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.660
I'll bring you some later then!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:19.370
That tomato was from our garden!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:23.340
My name's Isshiki Akane! What's yours?

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:29.090
Aoi...

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.600
My name's Futaba Aoi!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.270
We'll get along great, Aoi!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:39.440
Yeah!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:44.900
Come on, so now you're saying it's our fault we can't Dock?

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.440
I'm telling you the facts!

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.650
What's factual about it?!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:54.030
If we can't do it, then no one else could either!

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.910
Right, Aoi?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.000
Huh? Yeah...

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:05.550
When we were trying to Dock I could feel you flowing into me.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:11.050
During Docking, you share each other's consciousness and memories.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:14.680
I thought there wouldn't be a problem with the two of you...

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.310
And there aren't any!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:21.900
Can you honestly say you're not hiding anything from each other?

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.150
You're getting on my nerves, Gramps!

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:28.190
Very well. Let me check the program once again.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.870
Hey, Aoi! Let's do it right next time!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:35.240
I'm sure we can do it!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.620
Akane...

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:16.950
What happened?

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.080
The Alone recommenced operation!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.580
Its energy signal is growing rapidly!

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:24.420
It's overflowing! It's beyond what we can measure!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:50.730
This is bad! It's got a whole different grade of energy!

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.750
Horrible...

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.220
Akane!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:17.470
Akane! This is way out of your league!

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.970
Naked Rang!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.850
It bounced off?!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.060
Aoi!

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:31.530
Naked Impact!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.040
Are you okay, Aoi?

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:46.830
Aoi?

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.750
I'm sorry, Akane!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:56.050
I've been lying all this time.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:18:03.180
I was afraid you'd find out when we were about to Dock...

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:08.190
I actually hate tomatoes!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:14.190
I wanted to become friends with you, so I told you the tomato I didn't even eat was great!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:18.200
That's why we can't Dock! It's my fault!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.240
I'm so sorry, Akane!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:23.830
I know!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:31.040
Whenever there were tomatoes in our lunch, you'd eat them making this totally disgusted face!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.250
It was so obvious!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:38.630
But when I thought you were trying so hard not to let me down,

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:43.390
I felt it so... vividly!

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.470
Vividly?

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:49.520
Yeah! That we'd be able to stay together forever!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:52.060
That we'd be best friends forever!

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.030
Akane...

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.150
So don't cry!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:01.370
Aoi, you're my bestest friend!

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.120
Operation...

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.870
Vivid Blue!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:42.490
Aoi! We've become one!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.240
<i>Let's go, Akane!</i>

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:44.990
Yeah!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:50.000
Vivid Blue Operation!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.850
Vivid Impact! Release safety!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:12.100
<i>Energy output 120%!</i>

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.940
<i>150%!</i>

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:19.940
<b>Vivid overload! 200% output!</b>

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.450
<b>Final Operation!</b>

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:52.020
Looks like the crisis has been averted.

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:56.770
No. This is only the beginning, Shijou.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:00.650
The beginning of the war with our future at stake.

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.620
They got in the way...

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:14.410
Come on!

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:18.630
You oversleep every time you don't have to do newspaper delivery!

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.840
Sorry!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:23.340
It's just that I had to fight that evil monster all day yesterday...

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:26.590
Gramps told me about that, but...

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:32.100
I was really worried, y'know?

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:34.350
Momo...

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.270
Will there be more of those?

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:39.190
Are you gonna fight them again?

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:40.480
Yeah.

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:43.320
He says we're the only ones who can.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:47.950
Why can't I fight with you?

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:49.870
It's not fair.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:54.410
Let's go! Docking!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.710
Vivid Momo Operation!

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.420
Sis!

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:12.100
Huh? What happened?

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:15.140
Hey, Aoi!

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:16.020
Akane!

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:19.020
It's horrible! The school!

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:21.310
What happened?

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:26.650
The school's

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.160
completely destroyed...

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:37.910
You'll need to transfer schools.

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:41.250
Transfer schools?

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:16.850
<i>This is Saegusa Wakaba, heir apparent to the Heavenly Eye Style.</i>

00:24:16.850 --> 00:24:21.980
<i>Who is this eccentric red-haired girl who dares cross swords with me?!</i>

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:23.810
<i>Next time: True Strength.</i>

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:26.230
<i>I won't lose, no matter what!</i>
